@node clawtilla 0.52
@section clawtilla 0.52 in cmacs

@cindex clawtilla, notifications
@cindex clawtilla, tasks
@cindex clawtilla, pairing
@cindex clawtilla, parity

Between clawtilla 0.11 and 0.52 the daemon grew seventy-four frame kinds
the GTK client sends and this client did not, and eighteen pushed events
it handles that this one never named.  This section is what was built to
close that: where each thing is, what it asks the daemon, and what it
asks libclawt rather than deciding for itself.

@command{bash admin/cmacs-clawtilla-parity.sh} is the check.  It needs
no build, and at the time of writing it says every kind the GTK client
sends is reachable here.

